# SNR and Kinetic Modeling Tools

<div style="font-size: 20px;">

**This folder contains executable files to calculate SNR (Signal-to-Noise Ratio) and perform kinetic modeling.**

</div>

---

## For SNR Maps:

1. Download all SNR files from [`DynamicDMRSI/data/SNRs`](https://github.com/.../DynamicDMRSI/data/SNRs).
2. Place them in the **same folder** as:
   - `PlotSNRs_maps.p`
   - `subtightplot.m`

---

