---

### Requirements
- MATLAB R2019b or later
- [MATLAB Runtime](https://www.mathworks.com/products/compiler/matlab-runtime.html) (if compiled)

---

### Notes:
- Ensure that the SNR files are placed in the correct directory as specified.
- The script requires MATLAB and the associated Runtime to function correctly.
